      "comment": "MOMENT OF TRUTH (1) finished sixth last time at Grafton but could not have been more impressive before that in his powerful 19.94 win at Grafton over 350m. Can measure up on top win two back. RIPPLE ROSE (2) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 5 length third (17.22) over 300m at this track. Can feature again. KINGSBRAE SARAH (7) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (17.60) in a Grade 5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Key player if finds best. IMPRESSIVE GEM (4) jumps at a shorter journey and still warrants respect.",
